      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "After reverse engineering and modifying VRCSdkControlPanelAvatarBuilder.cs I was able to make the SDK spit it out\n\nLinux test avatars are located at ~/.local/share/VRChat/VRChat/Avatars/\n\nAs workaround I can symlink this to ~/.local/share/Steam/steamapps/compatdata/438100/pfx/drive_c/users/steamuser/AppData/LocalLow/VRChat/VRChat/\n\nBut it still would be nice to have a more elegant solution",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
    {
